","kind":"deal","tone":"good"},{"label":"Unregistered sale of equity","kind":"finance","tone":"warn"},{"label":"Regulation FD disclosure","kind":"news","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2019505/000121390026034716/0001213900-26-034716-index.htm"},{"date":"2026-03-25","form":"8-K","codes":["2.02","7.01","9.01"],"events":[{"label":"Results announced","kind":"results","tone":"blue"},{"label":"Regulation FD disclosure","kind":"news","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2019505/000121390026034165/0001213900-26-034165-index.htm"},{"date":"2025-12-02","form":"8-K","codes":["1.01","7.01","9.01"],"events":[{"label":"Material agreement entered","kind":"deal","tone":"good"},{"label":"Regulation FD disclosure","kind":"news","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2019505/000121390025116958/0001213900-25-116958-index.htm"},{"date":"2025-11-26","form":"8-K","codes":["5.02"],"events":[{"label":"Director or officer departure or appointment","kind":"people","tone":"warn"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2019505/000121390025115566/0001213900-25-115566-index.htm"}],"legal_events":[],"summary":{"sentences":["Health In Tech, Inc. files with the SEC under \"Insurance Agents, Brokers & Service\", based in FL, and has been publicly reporting for 1 year.","It reported $34.6m of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 9.4% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 51.4%.","Listed on Nasdaq, it is still consuming cash, with roughly 36 months of runway at the current burn."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Growth has been positive in all 4 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2019505/000121390026056707/0001213900-26-056707-index.htm","accession":"0001213900-26-056707"},{"text":"Gross margin of 51.4% means most of each additional sale falls through to cover fixed costs.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2019505/000121390026056707/0001213900-26-056707-index.htm","accession":"0001213900-26-056707"},{"text":"Net cash of $10.3m against total assets of $29.0m - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2019505/000121390026056707/0001213900-26-056707-index.htm","accession":"0001213900-26-056707"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (0.6% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2019505/000121390026056707/0001213900-26-056707-index.htm","accession":"0001213900-26-056707"}],"bear":[{"text":"Growth is erratic - a standard deviation of 32.3% across 4 comparisons. Lumpy revenue usually means few customers or long contracts, and both make any single quarter a poor guide.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2019505/000121390026056707/0001213900-26-056707-index.htm","accession":"0001213900-26-056707"},{"text":"Gross margin compressed from 66.8% to 51.4% against the same quarter a year earlier. Either input costs are rising or the company is discounting to hold volume.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2019505/000121390026056707/0001213900-26-056707-index.htm","accession":"0001213900-26-056707"},{"text":"About 36 months of cash at the current burn ($10.3m against $3.5m a year). A company that must raise is a company that raises on the buyer's terms.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2019505/000121390026056707/0001213900-26-056707-index.htm","accession":"0001213900-26-056707"},{"text":"Only 7 quarters of reported history. There is no track record here to speak of, and a short series flatters whatever the recent trend happens to be.","